# agent-market settings installed into Claude Code on work Linux hosts
# (devservers, ODs) by bootstrap-plugins. Install-only: removing a line does
# not uninstall the setting.
#
# fwdproxy: Claude Code has no outbound HTTP on a devserver without it, so
# WebFetch fails for every domain. Linux-only because the setting breaks
# outbound HTTP wherever fwdproxy:8080 is unreachable, and the Mac unsets
# https_proxy for exactly that reason (zshenv.local.meta-macos).
fwdproxy
